doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    include partials/head.pug
  body
    - var active = 'about'
    include partials/header.pug

    main.page-shell
      .container
        .page-card
          h1 About Our Transport System
          p The Smart Transport Management System helps students, staff, and drivers stay connected with reliable campus transportation for Metropolitan University, Sylhet.

          .info-grid
            .info-card
              .info-card-header
                .header-title
                  i.fas.fa-shield-alt
                  h3 Safe & Reliable
              p We prioritize punctual service, clear communication, and secure travel for every passenger.
            .info-card
              .info-card-header
                .header-title
                  i.fas.fa-users
                  h3 For Everyone
              p Our transport network is designed to support students, faculty, and visitors with comfortable access to campus.
            .info-card
              .info-card-header
                .header-title
                  i.fas.fa-database
                  h3 Database-Driven
              p Every route, stop and schedule shown in this app is managed live by the Admin Panel - no bus timings are hard-coded, so updates appear instantly for everyone.

        .page-card
          .info-card-header
            .header-title
              i.fas.fa-satellite-dish
              h3 Live GPS Tracking
          .future-feature-card
            i.fas.fa-clock
            span Reserved for a future release once university buses are fitted with GPS hardware. No simulated or fake locations are shown anywhere in this app today.

    include partials/footer.pug
